    "scenesThatPass": [
      "TINA: That's what it reminded me of -- that old jump rope song. Worst nightmare I ever had. You wouldn't believe it.\nNANCY: Matter of fact I had a bad dream last night myself...",
      "TINA: There's somebody out there, isn't there...\nNANCY: I didn't hear anything...",
      "NANCY: Then bring us back its tail and whiskers.\nTINA: Anyway, I don't have a cat...",
      "NANCY: She had a nightmare about somebody trying to kill her, last night. That's why we were there; she was afraid to sleep alone.\nMARGE: She's been through enough for one night. You have her statement.",
      "MARGE: Where you think you're going?\nNANCY: School.\nMARGE: I could hear you tossing and turning all night, kiddo. You've no business going to school.\nNANCY: I gotta go to school, Mom. Please. Otherwise I'll just sit up there and go crazy or something."
    ]
  },
